<title>MALAYSIA: Geahin up on requote after bonus news.</title>
<headline>Geahin up on requote after bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Geahin Engineering Bhd rose 4.55 percent in early trading on requotation, following announcement of a bonus issue.</p>
<p>Around 0250 GMT, the stock was up 70 cents to 16.10 ringgit on volume of 295,000 shares traded.  </p>
<p>The civil and structural engineering firm announced a 4-for-5 bonus issue, along with a rights issue and several acquisition proposals.</p>
